  "description": "Connects the OASIS to PostgreSQL — the world's most advanced open-source relational database. Stores OASIS holons and avatars using Npgsql (ADO.NET) with indexed lookup columns and full JSON serialisation. Compatible with PostgreSQL 12+ and managed services (Supabase, Neon, RDS, Azure). Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
